---
import Header from "@components/header.astro";
import "@styles/global.module.css";
import Scripts from "@components/scripts.astro";
import Footer from "@components/footer.astro";
import Meta from "@components/meta.astro";
import Cursor from "@components/cursor.astro";
import Buttons from "@components/Buttons.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <Meta name="Lunya's Button" description="Lunya finally made an 88x31 button for her website! Add it to your website and link back when you do so!" />
        <Scripts />
        <Cursor />
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://webring.nekoweb.org/onionring.css" />
        <script type="text/javascript" defer src="https://nekochat.mldchan.dev/js/nekochat.js" />
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://nekochat.mldchan.dev/css/nekochat.css" />
    </head>

    <body>
        <canvas id="background"></canvas>
        <!-- God damnit, I'm forced to use inline styles because Astro is stupid -->
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
            <Header />
            <main>
                <h1>Lunya's 88x31 button!</h1>

                <p>After countless months, I finally made an 88x31 button for my website! Add it to your website and link back when you do so!
                    This page was made for the blog post you probably clicked on, as the only other link to here is in the <a href="/sitemap">sitemap</a>.
                </p>

                <p>The button is available as a GIF file. I don't know if hotlinking will work, but you can always host it yourself.</p>
                <img src="/button.gif" alt="88x31 button" />

                <p>A list of buttons I added to my website:</p>

                <Buttons />

                <p>This list is exactly the same as the one on the main page of my website. Note that there probably won't be many buttons here,
                    as I have other projects than just Nekoweb and don't actively use Nekoweb. If you want your button to be added, you can hit
                    me up with an e-mail: <a href="mailto:mldkyt@proton.me">mldkyt@proton.me</a>.
                </p>

            </main>

            <Footer />
        </div>
        <script is:inline src="/scripts/background.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
